            </geometry>
        </visual>
    </link>
    <!-- Mixed native/weed scatter gently thins away from world (0, 0),
         with coverage through the middle and outer map. Decimal positions
         and varied headings avoid rows.
         The world rotates this model +90 degrees about X: local (x, 0, z)
         becomes world (x, -z, 0). Local Y stays zero on the flat ground;
         local pitch varies the heading around the world's vertical axis. -->
